text:
BAB III
ASAS DAN TUJUAN
Pasal 3
Perlindungan perempuan dan anak dari tindak kekerasan dan  diskriminasi diselenggarakan berdasarkan asas:
a. penghormatan hak asasi manusia;
b. keadilan dan kesetaraan gender;
c. nondiskriminasi;
d. perlindungan korban;
e. pemberdayaan; dan
f. keterpaduan.

translated_text:
CHAPTER III
PRINCIPLES AND OBJECTIVES
Article 3
Protection of women and children from acts of violence and discrimination is organized based on the principles of:
a. respect for human rights;
b. justice and gender equality;
c. non-discrimination;
d. victim protection;
e. empowerment; and
f. integration.

text:
Pasal 4
Tujuan perlindungan perempuan dan anak dari tindak kekerasan  dan diskriminasi adalah:
a. mencegah tindak kekerasan dan diskriminasi terhadap  perempuan dan anak termasuk perdagangan orang;  b. menghapus segala bentuk kekerasan, diskriminasi, dan  eksploitasi terhadap perempuan dan anak;
c. melindungi perempuan dan anak dari tindakan kekerasan dan  diskriminasi dalam mendapatkan hak-haknya yang sah secara  konstitusi;
d. melindungi dan memberikan rasa aman bagi perempuan dan  anak;
e. memberikan pelayanan dan perlindungan kepada perempuan  dan anak korban tindak kekerasan dan diskriminasi, pelapor,  dan saksi; dan
f. memfasilitasi dan melakukan mediasi terhadap sengketa  rumah tangga untuk mewujudkan keutuhan rumah tangga  yang harmonis dan sejahtera.

translated_text:
Article 4
The objectives of protection of women and children from acts of violence and discrimination are:
a. to prevent acts of violence and discrimination against women and children including trafficking in persons;
b. to eliminate all forms of violence, discrimination, and exploitation against women and children;
c. to protect women and children from acts of violence and discrimination in obtaining their constitutional rights;
d. to protect and provide a sense of security for women and children;
e. to provide services and protection to women and children victims of acts of violence and discrimination, reporters, and witnesses; and
f. to facilitate and conduct mediation of domestic disputes to realize the integrity of a harmonious and prosperous household.

